MusicSquare Personal (随听) Android adaptation, 2026.
Based in part on CharlesPikachu/musicsquare by Zhenchao Jin and contributors.
Upstream: https://github.com/CharlesPikachu/musicsquare
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0.
Modifications: new mobile HTML/CSS/JS UI; Android Java host; Media3 service;
native network adapters; local library persistence and JSON transfer; testing.

AndroidX Media3 1.6.1 and AndroidX WebKit 1.12.1: Apache License 2.0.
Gradle Wrapper: Gradle project, Apache License 2.0.
